### L-01 Update volunteer location (requires active assignment)
PATCH {{host}}/api/volunteers/me/location
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 12.9200,
  "longitude": 74.8620
}

### L-02 Set volunteer available
PATCH {{host}}/api/volunteers/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_available": true
}

### L-02 Set volunteer unavailable
PATCH {{host}}/api/volunteers/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_available": false
}

### L-02 Invalid payload -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/volunteers/me/availability
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_available": "not-a-bool"
}

